'''Tasmanian Giant Crab''' (タスマニアオオガニ, ''Tasumaniaōgani'', '''Tasmanian Giant Crab''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]] and [[Summer Break Cats (Gauntlet)|Summer Break Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Tasmanian Giant Crab
|image = E 153.png
|appearance = [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Summer Break Cats (Gauntlet)|Summer Break Cats]]
|money drop = 400¢ - 1,580¢
}}

==Enemy==
The Tasmanian Giant Crab is tougher than most other peons in its collab, and does about 300 damage. Its low range means it often won't be a threat on its own, but when buffed proves to be much more dangerous.

==Strategy==
As mentioned before, this enemy isn't very threatening, so a combination of [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and/or [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] paired with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] should take it out easily. Area attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] can take groups of them, making her a great choice against it.

